[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0117","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-5868","title":"OpenVPN Access Server CRLF注入漏洞","description":"OpenVPN Access Server 2.1.4 版本的 Web 管理界面存在 CRLF 注入漏洞（CWE-93），攻击者可在 __session_start__/ 路径的 PATH_INFO 参数中注入 %0A（换行符），注入任意 HTTP 响应头。攻击者无需认证即可发起攻击，但需诱导受害者点击恶意链接（UI:R），成功后可实施会话固定攻击或 HTTP 响应拆分攻击，窃取会话 Cookie 或污染缓存，影响 OpenVPN Access Server 2.1.4 版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络、低攻击复杂度、需用户交互、权限范围改变、机密性/完整性低影响、无可用性影响。官方已发布修复版本，建议升级至 2.1.4 以上版本并启用 HTTP 头过滤。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-5868"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-26T01:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:21:21Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenVPN Access Server 2.1.5 或更高版本以修复漏洞。修改配置文件，禁用不必要的服务端口，并应用安全补丁。临时缓解措施是在 Web 应用防火墙中过滤包含 \"%0A\" 等特殊字符的 HTTP 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2017/05/23/13","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038547","https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2017-05-05-cve-2017-5868-openvpn-access-server-crlf-injection-with-session-fixation/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5868.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-5868.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/c9097bc88f77c877a08830c8bb997e760d5172eb/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-5868.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2017/5xxx/CVE-2017-5868.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/openvpn/openvpn_access_server/CVE-2017-5868.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-5868.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-5868.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2017/CVE-2017-5868.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-5868","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-5868.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2017-5868.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0130","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9140","title":"Telerik Reporting Report Viewer 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Telerik Reporting for ASP.NET WebForms 的 Report Viewer 控件（Telerik.ReportViewer.WebForms.dll）在 R1 2017 SP2（11.0.17.406）之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 Telerik.ReportViewer.axd 处理程序传递特制的 bgColor 参数注入任意 web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当受害者浏览器解析该响应时恶意脚本将在其会话上下文中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Telerik Reporting 组件的 Web 应用程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9140"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-22T05:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:27:33Z","remediation":"升级 Telerik Reporting 至 R1 2017 SP2（11.0.17.406）或更高版本，该版本已修复 bgColor 参数的输入验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）上添加规则过滤 bgColor 参数中的 `<script>`、`<img>` 等 HTML 标签及 JavaScript 事件处理器，并对用户输入执行 HTML 编码转义。同时配置 Content-Security-Policy 响应头限制脚本执行来源作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.telerik.com/support/whats-new/reporting/release-history/telerik-reporting-r1-2017-sp2-%28version-11-0-17-406%29","https://knowledgebase.progress.com/articles/Article/Security-Advisory-for-Resolving-Security-vulnerabilities-September-2018","https://www.veracode.com/blog/research/anatomy-cross-site-scripting-flaw-telerik-reporting-module","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9140.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-9140.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9140.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-9140.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9140-3081.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9140-3080.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-9140-3083.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-9140.js","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9140.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-9140.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/be9cbbdcace5bb1f0274d67feb2141e8b491875d/plugins/progress/telerik_reporting/CVE-2017-9140.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0130.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0002","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9047","title":"libxml2 xmlSnprintfElements 堆栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"libxml2 的 valid.c 文件中 xmlSnprintfElements 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。当对不可信文档或外部 DTD 进行 DTD 验证时，攻击者可通过构造特制的 XML 文件触发该漏洞。漏洞成因在于函数在拼接元素内容定义到缓冲区时，未使用更新后的缓冲区长度进行边界检查，导致可越界写入约\"size\"字节数据。该漏洞可导致使用 libxml2 库的程序（如 PHP）崩溃，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。受影响版本包括 libxml2 2.9.4 及之前版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9047"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2017-05-18T06:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:27:23Z","remediation":"升级 libxml2 至 2.9.5 及以上版本。各发行版用户可通过包管理器更新（如 apt upgrade libxml2、yum update libxml2）。PHP 用户需同时升级 php-xml 扩展并重启 Web 服务。如无法立即升级，作为临时缓解措施，可避免对不可信文档执行 DTD 验证，或设置 LIBXML_DTDLOAD 与 LIBXML_DTDATTR 解析选项为 0 以禁用外部 DTD 加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2017/dsa-3952","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2017/05/15/1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98599","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r58af02e294bd07f487e2c64ffc0a29b837db5600e33b6e698b9d696b%40%3Cissues.bookkeeper.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf4c02775860db415b4955778a131c2795223f61cb8c6a450893651e4%40%3Cissues.bookkeeper.apache.org%3E","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201711-01","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2017/CVE-2017-9047.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f655f864c18bd25e1fca21f5741c644854233bf0/cves/2017/9xxx/CVE-2017-9047.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b3f14a770d93b602b06aecf87f2033bd6818a62d/osv/cve/2017/UBUNTU-CVE-2017-9047.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2017-9047","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/nuget/libxml2/CVE-2017-9047.yml","https://github.com/vmware/photon/blob/0b37ad6f1c30ccbcabda429e5ce34657065d26ca/SPECS/libxml2/libxml2.spec","https://github.com/unprovable/OrchidMantis/blob/b5893f26d79c98b214daae2877ab2f2ac54b8192/targets/04-libxml2-cve-2017-9047-upstream.c","https://github.com/fullwaywang/QlRules/blob/241853bffb1f550aca9b1eba7b1c65f00f09ae18/libxml2/CVE-2017-9047-932cc98/xmlSnprintfElementContent-autogen.ql","https://github.com/alibaba/AliOS-Things-Linux-Edition/blob/a78f19107de74beaef40b33c9648cf5dadce37e6/meta-yp/meta/recipes-core/libxml/libxml2/libxml2-CVE-2017-9047_CVE-2017-9048.patch","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/d608525060b1c7d4a9217b60250c9f4de771ba90/gems/nokogiri/CVE-2017-9050.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0114","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-4011","title":"McAfee Network Data Loss Prevention 9.3.x HTTP Header 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"McAfee Network Data Loss Prevention (NDLP) 9.3.x 版本的服务端存在 HTTP 头部跨站脚本 (XSS) 漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器对 HTTP 请求头部缺乏充分的输入验证与输出编码，远程攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本的 HTTP 请求头（如 User-Agent、Referer 等），诱导管理员访问受影响的 NDLP 管理控制台页面时触发脚本执行。成功利用可窃取管理员的会话 Cookie、会话令牌等敏感信息，进而劫持管理员会话、执行任意管理操作。攻击条件为：目标运行 NDLP 9.3.x、攻击者能发送 HTTP 请求到服务器、管理员需访问包含恶意头部的页面（需用户交互 UI:R）。CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），向量 AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:N。影响范围限于 McAfee NDLP 9.3.x 系列产品。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-4011"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-17T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:19:13Z","remediation":"升级到McAfee Network Data Loss Prevention 12.0或更高版本，应用2020-2022年度全部安全补丁包；修改NDLP服务器httpd.conf配置文件，启用XSS防护模块并配置安全策略HEADERS={'X-XSS-Protection':'1; mode=block','Content-Security-Policy':'default-src '\\''self'\\''; script-src '\\''self'\\'','X-Content-Type-Options':'nosniff'}；启用日志记录和告警功能，监控HTTP头中特殊字符注入尝试；定期更新Web应用防火墙规则集，拦截包含<script>alert(1)</script>等XSS载荷的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038523","https://kc.mcafee.com/corporate/index?page=content&id=SB10198","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-4011.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-4011.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d45959218d975ac3d65b6dea81478745e4a6e03d/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-4011.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2017-4011.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-4011-3020.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-4011-3018.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2017/4xxx/CVE-2017-4011.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2017/CVE-2017-4011.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Intel McAfee Network Data Loss Prevention（NDLP）/CVE-2017-4011.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-4011/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-4011.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-4011.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0114.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0114.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0109","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0263","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k 特权提升漏洞","description":"Win32k 内核态驱动程序的菜单管理组件中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。本地攻击者可通过运行特制的应用程序触发该漏洞，在内核上下文中执行任意代码，从而获取 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8.1、Windows 10、Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，无需用户交互即可完成提权。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0263"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-12T14:29:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:57:21Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 5 月安全更新（MS17-017）。各版本对应补丁编号：Windows 7 SP1 安装 KB4015217，Windows 8.1 安装 KB4015550，Windows 10 各版本安装 KB4015217/KB4015438/KB4019472，Windows Server 2012/2016 安装对应补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可限制非管理员用户登录系统作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98258","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038449","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0263","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44478/","https://xiaodaozhi.com/exploit/117.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0263","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44478","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0263.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-0263.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2017-0263/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0263","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/sednit/2017-05-09_Trump_Attack_on_Syria_IoCs.adoc","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0263.json","https://github.com/jekil/awesome-hacking/blob/3cb71ba9ab1ba31737dfbde9d3f1bba6c10627ba/_pages/index.rst","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/221%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-0263.txt","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/bc76bf461beecebb7c648559b93e442ec7025acb/archive/2022/2022-06-22.md","https://github.com/R06otMD5/cve-2017-0263-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0106","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0261","title":"Microsoft Office 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 在处理内存对象时存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的 Office 文档并诱使用户打开来触发该漏洞。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者可获取与当前用户相同的权限，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码，安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。该漏洞影响 Office 2010 SP2、Office 2013 SP1 及 Office 2016 等多个版本，已被 Sednit/APT28 等高级持续性威胁组织在野利用。用户交互是唯一攻击条件，预览窗格亦可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0261"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-12T14:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:57:21Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 5 月发布的 Office 安全更新：Office 2010 SP2 安装 KB3199167，Office 2013 SP1 安装 KB3199158，Office 2016 安装 KB3199166。也可通过 Microsoft Update 或 Windows Update 自动检测并安装。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议优先修复。如无法立即打补丁，可配置 Office 在受保护视图下打开来自互联网的文档，并禁用 OLE 对象嵌入功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98104","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038444","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0261","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0261","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0261.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-0261.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0261","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/sednit/2017-05-09_Trump_Attack_on_Syria_IoCs.adoc","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0261.json","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2017/database/CVE-2017-0261/CVE-2017-0261-erfze.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-0261.txt","https://github.com/atc-project/atomic-threat-coverage/blob/4270e4e6f267d9019858f6eace7896178cf156d4/Atomic_Threat_Coverage/Detection_Rules/win_exploit_cve_2017_0261.md","https://github.com/Yamato-Security/WELA-deprecated/blob/3e3dae1af994354c5d2cab15d78ac79c446317a8/Rules/SIGMA/process_creation/win_exploit_cve_2017_0261.ps1","https://github.com/HydraDragonAntivirus/HydraDragonAntivirus/blob/d1f5f4f589e1a67e8f68fb7892c522bb7c4c723b/hayabusa/rules/sigma/sysmon/emerging-threats/2017/Exploits/CVE-2017-0261/proc_creation_win_exploit_cve_2017_0261.yml","https://github.com/kcufId/eps-CVE-2017-0261","https://github.com/erfze/CVE-2017-0261"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0106.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0106.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0100","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0222","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 内存损坏漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 存在内存损坏漏洞，当 IE 引擎在内存中不当访问对象时触发该漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页来利用此漏洞，成功利用后可获得与当前用户相同的权限，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。攻击者可借此安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。该漏洞需要用户交互（点击链接），影响 Internet Explorer 9/10/11 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0222"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-12T14:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:57:17Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 5 月安全更新 (MS17-006)，该补丁修复了 Internet Explorer 内存损坏漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或访问 Microsoft 安全响应中心下载。如无法打补丁，可配置组策略将 IE 安全级别设为高，禁用 ActiveX 控件和活动脚本，或改用 Edge/Chrome 等现代浏览器。同时建议在网络边界部署入侵检测规则拦截针对该漏洞的攻击流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98127","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038423","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0222","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0222","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0222.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0222.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0222","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0222.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-0222/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-0222.txt","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-0222.md","https://github.com/davidwowa/tech.cybersword.scm/blob/9f9c8b8f3096e9ea4ebdd18591194da9280c6375/tex/backup/202502122308/CVE-2017-0222.tex","https://github.com/dodger487/scrape_hn/blob/e32869e04292c70b37a11511272c441cabc478b8/stories/14306310.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0099","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0213","title":"Microsoft Windows COM 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows COM Aggregate Marshaler 组件在处理 IRemUnknown2 接口时存在类型混淆漏洞，导致本地权限提升。本地攻击者可通过运行特制应用程序触发该漏洞，以当前用户权限执行任意代码，从而获取目标系统的高权限控制。该漏洞影响 Windows 7/8.1/10/Server 2008/2012/2016 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2017 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，且该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0213"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-12T14:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:57:16Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 5 月安全更新：Windows 10 1607 安装 KB4019472，Windows 10 1703 安装 KB4016871，Windows 7 SP1 安装 KB4019264，Windows 8.1 安装 KB4019215，Windows Server 2008/2012/2016 安装对应月度安全更新。如无法打补丁，可限制非管理员用户运行未信任应用程序，并启用 Windows Defender 应用程序控制策略作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98102","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1038457","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-0213","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42020/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0213","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42020","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0213.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-0213.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2017-0213/README.md","https://github.com/WindowsExploits/Exploits/blob/ccaaf21ef8fc92941ea285e0160071148631637c/CVE-2017-0213/Readme.md","https://github.com/hermit-hacker/OSCP-Study-Notes/blob/6c2587a4c4df26b2e9ad7b43ef299908055e5313/PrivEsc/Windows/CVE-2017-0213.zip","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0213","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0213.json","https://github.com/SecWiki/windows-kernel-exploits/blob/2b944b52ee30f8833a21f0805d2627ca1f15383a/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-0213.txt","https://github.com/xiaoy-sec/Pentest_Note/blob/52156f816f0c2497c25343c2e872130193acca80/wiki/%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87/Windows%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83/Searchsploit.md","https://github.com/zcgonvh/CVE-2017-0213","https://github.com/eonrickity/CVE-2017-0213","https://github.com/jbooz1/CVE-2017-0213","https://github.com/shaheemirza/CVE-2017-0213-","https://github.com/billa3283/CVE-2017-0213"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0108","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-0262","title":"Microsoft Office 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2010 SP2、2013 SP1 及 2016 版本在处理内存对象时存在远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Office 文档（如 Word、Excel 文件）并诱使用户打开，触发内存处理错误，从而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（打开恶意文件）。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，实际攻击中常被用于鱼叉式钓鱼邮件投递恶意文档，实现初始入侵。Microsoft 已于 2017 年 5 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2017-0262"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-05-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2017-05-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 5 月安全更新：Office 2010 SP2 安装 KB3191937，Office 2013 SP1 安装 KB3191932，Office 2016 安装 KB3191938。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议在邮件网关层面拦截包含 OLE 对象的可疑文档，并提醒用户不要打开来源不明的 Office 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-0262","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-0262.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2017/0xxx/CVE-2017-0262.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-0262","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/sednit/2017-05-09_Trump_Attack_on_Syria_IoCs.adoc","https://github.com/Cyb3rWard0g/HELK/blob/ad752b2a0d56110c0df49fa3e9e5e19f556039db/docker/helk-jupyter/notebooks/sigma/win_exploit_cve_2017_0261.ipynb","https://github.com/Mr-xn/RedTeam_BlueTeam_HW/blob/cbac586d62eedd75114b6f0aa1d8c994fef0ed87/security_wike.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-0262.txt","https://github.com/atc-project/atomic-threat-coverage/blob/4270e4e6f267d9019858f6eace7896178cf156d4/Atomic_Threat_Coverage/Detection_Rules/win_exploit_cve_2017_0261.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2017/CVE-2017-0262.json","https://github.com/Yamato-Security/WELA-deprecated/blob/3e3dae1af994354c5d2cab15d78ac79c446317a8/Rules/SIGMA/process_creation/win_exploit_cve_2017_0261.ps1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1109","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-7921","title":"海康威视多款网络摄像机身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"海康威视多款网络摄像头（DS-2CD2xx2F-I、DS-2CD2xx0F-I、DS-2CD2xx2FWD、DS-2CD4x2xFWD、DS-2CD4xx5、DS-2DFx、DS-2CD63xx等系列）存在不正确身份验证漏洞，受影响固件版本为V5.0.9至V5.4.5。漏洞成因是设备应用程序未能对用户身份进行充分且正确的验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制请求绕过认证机制，直接提升自身权限并获得管理员级访问权限，进而窃取敏感视频监控数据、读取设备配置信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，在互联网上可直接利用，危害等级严重。海康威视已发布固件更新修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-7921"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-05-06T00:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:25:28Z","remediation":"立即将受影响型号的摄像头固件升级至厂商发布的安全版本：DS-2CD2xx2F-I 系列升级至 V5.4.5 build 170123 及更高版本，DS-2CD2xx0F-I 系列升级至 V5.4.5 Build 170123 及更高版本，DS-2CD2xx2FWD 系列升级至 V5.4.5 Build 170124 及更高版本，DS-2CD4x2xFWD 系列升级至 V5.4.5 Build 170228 及更高版本，DS-2CD4xx5 系列升级至 V5.4.5 Build 170302 及更高版本，DS-2DFx 系列升级至 V5.4.9 Build 170123 及更高版本，DS-2CD63xx 系列升级至 V5.4.5 Build 170206 及更高版本。升级前请确认设备为正规授权渠道购买，避免因非授权固件导致升级失败或界面异常。临时缓解措施包括：通过防火墙限制摄像头 Web 接口仅允许可信网络访问，禁止直接从互联网暴露摄像头管理端口，禁用不必要的 UPnP 功能，修改默认管理员密码并启用强认证策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.hikvision.com/us/about_10805.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/98313","https://ghostbin.com/paste/q2vq2","https://ics-cert.us-cert.gov/advisories/ICSA-17-124-01","https://www.hikvision.com/cn/suppo